: straight-through 60-pin host harness; A=odd, B=even; 59/60 NC. Separate unqualified EFS58 adapter." (at 20 23.599999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid c5983eae-da80-538d-99b6-e71b2cf5e32f))(text "J7 reserve POWER only: 1 GND, 2 raw module 5V, 3 backed VSYS. Keep D1 fitted; optional daughter not included." (at 20 30.599999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid aa021c5e-8dc2-5ce3-84fb-a79513a93ad2))(text "SD and connector drawing approval remain open. RESET2 input only. Power off before mode or cable changes." (at 20 37.599999999999994 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 05d08451-3e26-5272-bb8c-46898a629bb4)))
